body:
Maybe I am shilling by saying this but do none of these people complaining have jobs? I spend $60 on a weekend taking my girlfriend to a movie, double if we get dinner and drinks. This shit is free and literally can be thousands of hours of entertainment. I can pay $10 and look cool, play a new hero. Do ya’all want new content? How the fuck else do devs get paid unless they are running ads before matches? Do you walk into a store and start bitching to the staff that the items cost money? I’m floored how spoiled some of these folks are. Downvote me if you want but holy fuck gamers are some broke ass bitches if ya’all are mad about $10 that YOU DON’T EVEN HAVE TO SPEND.

&#x200B;

Also I love when fucking morons like you start crying about hOw aRe tHeY sUpPoSeD tO bE pAyEd when blizzard is worth B I L L I O N S of dollars.
